    "title": "Local Troy University students earn Provost's and Chancellor's List honors for Term 3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Reports ,\n7 hours ago Troy University recently announced that local students have been named to the Provost's List for Term 3 of the 2025-2026 academic year. Fulltime undergraduate students who are registered for at least 12 semester hours and who have a grade point average of at least 3.65 qualify for the Provost's List. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
